WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:07.000
You can read this word without trying.
Naming its ink may take longer.

00:00:07.000 --> 00:00:14.000
That difference has a name: Stroop interference,
the competition between familiar responses.

00:00:14.000 --> 00:00:21.000
In a study, a suggestion altered the task
for some highly suggestible participants.

00:00:21.000 --> 00:00:28.000
That is an experiment—not evidence that
every audio product changes your brain.

00:00:28.000 --> 00:00:35.000
First, try a free twelve-minute observation
of your own attention.

00:00:35.000 --> 00:00:42.000
Read the trial. Try the baseline.
Decide for yourself what guidance is worth.
